%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: NoeIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  isForced: 1
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Here. ID, form, filled out in the bread line. Noe Barbaqadze. I run the corner grocery on the eastern block.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: The shop's still open. I go every morning, check the empty shelves, stand a while, then close.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Why keep it open?
      npcResponse: Force of habit, I think. Routine feels more normal than the alternative.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
      playLaughSfx: 0
    - playerChoiceText: That sounds bleak.
      npcResponse: Does it? I've been standing in lines my whole life, first bread, then permits. Just a new kind of line.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
      playLaughSfx: 0
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I live alone, quiet apartment. My neighbor stopped answering his door two weeks ago. I haven't knocked since. I'm fine.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I have nowhere urgent to be, same as yesterday. Permit, September expiry, the dates have started to blur.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Does the wait bother you?
      npcResponse: No. I have nowhere urgent to be on the other side either.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
      playLaughSfx: 0
    - playerChoiceText: Have you always lived here?
      npcResponse: My whole life, same street and district. I thought about leaving once, the line for the exit was too long.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
      playLaughSfx: 0
